      "message": "When the gate publishes multiple terminal lanes, each call to runPrReviewPublishWithProvider re-runs loadSiblingSynthesisLanes, which fully validateLaneEvidence-s every other expected lane (sync lstat/read/JSON parse/provenance/digest). For L publishable lanes this is ~L×(L−1) full evidence validations per gate, plus per-lane resolveModelHead and sequential provider publish. L is bounded by the active focus set (~half a dozen to a dozen) so this is not merge-blocking, but this PR increases how often partial/blocking rounds take the multi-publish path.",
